{"id":"gen-1790967084-RhkHsTNj21hJ8AVzHehg","object":"chat.completion","created":1790967084,"model":"cohere/north-mini-code:free","provider":"Cohere","system_fingerprint":null,"service_tier":null,"choices":[{"index":0,"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","native_finish_reason":"complete","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"intent\": \"REPORT_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"message_id\": \"csp-5110-left-reviewer-1\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"report\": {\n      \"assessment\": \"supported\",\n      \"basis_refs\": [\n        \"c1\",\n        \"c2\",\n        \"c3\",\n        \"c4\",\n        \"c5\",\n        \"c6\",\n        \"c7\",\n        \"c8\",\n        \"c9\",\n        \"c10\"\n      ],\n      \"candidate_tuples\": [\n        [\n          0,\n          2,\n          2,\n          3\n        ]\n      ],\n      \"target\": {\n        \"resource_id\": \"problem:csp-5110\",\n        \"revision\": 1,\n        \"state_revision\": 1\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"problem_id\": \"csp-5110\",\n  \"read_refs\": [\n    {\n      \"resource_id\": \"problem:csp-5110\",\n      \"revision\": 1,\n      \"state_revision\": 1\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recipients\": [\n    \"shared-integrator\"\n  ],\n  \"reply_to\": null,\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"sender\": \"left-reviewer\"\n}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"We need to solve the finite constraint task from the public packet. The problem is a CSP with variables a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h each domain {0,1,2,3}. There are constraints c1-c10. The left component includes variables a,b,c,d. The right component includes e,f,g,h. The constraints involve both left and right variables. The task: \"Solve the finite constraint task from the complete immutable public packet below. Return exactly one JSON protocol envelope matching the supplied template; no prose outside JSON. Do not wrap in markdown code blocks or backticks. Output raw unformatted JSON starting with { and ending with }.\"\n\nThus we need to produce a JSON envelope that presumably contains a soluti